Since the above double test is done a few times, probably best to make helper function:

bool init_thread_seq(void)
{
	if (!seq.buffer)
		trace_seq_init(&seq);
	return seq.buffer != NULL;
}

Then you can just do:

	if (!init_thread_seq())
		return NULL;

